+`DELETE /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}` is for org admins of that organization
+(other members get 403, other organizations 404, a user outside the org 404).
+It removes the user's memberships in all projects of the org, including
+archived ones, and unassigns their tasks so the assignee rule keeps holding.
+The user row itself is kept.
 
